WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
End of the day. Time Out closes the timesheet, and the hours are already added up.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.477
One button turns the day into a report.

00:00:08.477 --> 00:00:12.719
If you turn it on, a narrative draft writes itself from your entries.

00:00:12.719 --> 00:00:16.100
It is yours to edit, and it only sees what you allowed.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:21.898
The cover carries your firm's logo and colors, set once per project.

00:00:21.898 --> 00:00:26.610
Weather, checklist, compliance, photos with captions. Nothing retyped.

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:32.570
Every report is kept. Reopen any day, re-export any version.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.797
Submit the day to the project. Your reviewer gets it.

00:00:36.797 --> 00:00:38.210
You are done for the day.
